{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23330","headline":"双石 · 白居易","name":"双石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苍然两片石，厥状怪且丑。\n俗用无所堪，时人嫌不取。\n结从胚浑始，得自洞庭口。\n万古遗水滨，一朝入吾手。\n担舁来郡内，洗刷去泥垢。\n孔黑烟痕深，罅青苔色厚。\n老蛟蟠作足，古剑插爲首。\n忽疑天上落，不似人间有。\n一可支吾琴，一可贮吾酒。\n峭绝高数尺，坳泓容一斗。\n五弦倚其左，一桮置其右。\n洼樽酌未空，玉山颓已久。\n人皆有所好，物各求其偶。\n渐恐少年场，不容垂白叟。\n回头问双石，能伴老夫否。\n石虽不能言，许我爲三友。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23330.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23330","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}